Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.99,0:01:45.00,sign_7050_55_Episode_1_______,Eptitle sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(528,479)\pos(474,307)}Episode 9            A Person To Love
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.00,0:01:50.28,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Senpai is popular at college...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.55,0:01:57.68,main - flashback,Eiji,0,0,0,,A classmate of mine \Nasked me out at college today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.40,0:02:05.97,main,Megu,0,0,0,,Are you gonna get homewrecked?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.48,0:02:12.48,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Nooo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.74,0:02:19.19,main,Rin,0,0,0,,No way! No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.16,0:02:18.79,main - top,Megu,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure you don't need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.10,0:02:24.29,main,Rin,0,0,0,,This is an end-of-the-universe level disaster...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.29,0:02:26.04,main,Megu,0,0,0,,That is some sense of scale.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.04,0:02:28.87,main,Rin,0,0,0,,It's because Senpai's cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.87,0:02:33.93,main,Rin,0,0,0,,And... he's fun to be around, \Nand in spite of how he seems,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.93,0:02:36.80,main,Rin,0,0,0,,you can always rely on him in a pinch!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.05,0:02:39.04,main,Rin,0,0,0,,And then there's the fact...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.04,0:02:41.05,main,Ayaka,0,0,0,,I like Onii-chan too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.81,0:02:44.88,main,Megu,0,0,0,,To be honest, I do too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.88,0:02:46.05,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Wha?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.68,0:02:57.12,main,Rin,0,0,0,,This stupid world... \NI'll destroy this stupid world!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.12,0:02:58.99,main,Megu,0,0,0,,Disproportionate!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.21,0:03:03.82,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,How are things in drama lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.43,0:03:07.64,main,Rin,0,0,0,,We've got a promising new rookie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.04,0:03:10.22,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,What's he like?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.22,0:03:12.14,main,Rin,0,0,0,,It's a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.14,0:03:14.86,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Huh, wish I could meet her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.86,0:03:19.34,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Oh... right... sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.34,0:03:21.93,main,Rin,0,0,0,,How are things at college, Senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.18,0:03:23.09,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.30,0:03:28.83,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Well, my drama club didn't meet, \Nso it was pretty uneventful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.59,0:03:30.56,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.64,0:03:35.10,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I'd like to hear more... \Nabout how college is going.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.44,0:03:37.87,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Why? You worried about something?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.87,0:03:40.36,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Oh, no, not at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.80,0:03:44.36,main,Rin,0,0,0,,If nothing's going on, \Nthat's good to know, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.60,0:03:48.26,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,If you say so, but let me know \Nif anything comes up, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.55,0:03:50.62,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I wanna be there to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.49,0:03:54.38,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,He has to be popular!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.76,0:03:57.95,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,That made me happy... \NBut it'll make him popular!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.68,0:04:05.04,main,Rin,0,0,0,,H-Honestly... I've been really wondering \Nif you're popular at college...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.04,0:04:05.80,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.21,0:04:08.17,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,What the heck made you think that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.17,0:04:10.32,main,Rin,0,0,0,,That girl asked you out...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.32,0:04:13.77,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,That was just... I mean, \NI sure don't feel popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.81,0:04:18.18,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Besides, it's not like I have time \Nto think about other girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.34,0:04:20.60,main,Rin,0,0,0,,You're bound to be popular!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.60,0:04:21.53,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,But why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.15,0:04:28.12,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Senpai... are you doing anything tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.12,0:04:33.08,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Oh, tomorrow is the anniversary \Nof the high school's founding, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.08,0:04:34.54,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Gotta love a day off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.84,0:04:37.78,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I'd like to see you \Nwhen you're done with class...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.78,0:04:41.64,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,But I've got club tomorrow...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.39,0:04:45.23,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,How about you come by the campus, Rin?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.84,0:04:51.90,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Oh, well... I'd love to, \Nbut... is that allowed?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.24,0:04:55.06,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,If someone says something, \Nwe'll just say you've come for a tour.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.39,0:04:57.56,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You can even sneak into a class!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.48,0:05:02.76,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,Now I can actually check \Nand see how popular he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.24,0:05:05.58,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,But it's kind of scary...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.73,0:05:08.19,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,But I get to see Senpai first thing \Nin the morning tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.80,0:05:11.83,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,What should I wear?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.00,0:05:14.73,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You're as expressive as you've always been.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.73,0:05:15.96,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You realize I can see you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.08,0:05:21.13,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,And now the screen's blacked out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.65,0:05:25.35,main,Rin,0,0,0,,The camera's malfunctioning... that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.99,0:05:36.97,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I've successfully snuck in!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.24,0:05:39.31,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Just gotta keep a low profile.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.62,0:05:43.32,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,If I signal you like this, \Nthen you need to hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.57,0:05:44.13,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.47,0:05:52.33,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,I'm attending the same class as Senpai...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.59,0:05:53.88,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,It's like a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.66,0:05:57.80,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,Wait, no! I need to observe him today!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.96,0:06:02.83,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,A sporty girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.83,0:06:05.84,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,I bet she'd get along with Senpai, \Nwith how energetic they are...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.14,0:06:07.27,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,Like some sort of Cheerful-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.99,0:06:12.56,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,She's gorgeous!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.56,0:06:14.84,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,And she's got sexy body language...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.84,0:06:16.11,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,A Classy-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.62,0:06:22.32,main,Rin,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.27,0:06:25.05,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Isn't that the signal to hide?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.37,0:06:35.37,sign_9432_77_Guess_who_,Signs,0,0,0,,Guess who?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.63,0:06:48.63,sign_9702_79_Imp_chan_after_o,Sign,0,0,0,,{\frz355.3\pos(309,122)\fs16\c&H51555A&}Imp-chan after our gazes have met \Nfor the third time during class.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.04,0:06:48.64,main - italics,Eiji,0,0,0,,Imp-chan after our gazes have met \Nfor the third time during class.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.35,0:06:52.55,main - italics,Eiji,0,0,0,,Gimme another quiz!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.39,0:07:01.40,sign_9702_79_Imp_chan_after_o,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs10\pos(489,274)\frz358.2}Rin, who is always\N using her acting \Nto help people \Nhave a good time!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.04,0:07:00.92,main - italics,Eiji,0,0,0,,Rin, who is always using her acting \Nto help people have a good time!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.40,0:07:08.40,sign_9702_79_Imp_chan_after_o,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(488,270)\frz0.1191}{\fs10\pos(489,274)\frz358.2}This'd be embarrassing \Nto say out loud, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.37,0:07:08.03,main - italics,Eiji,0,0,0,,This'd be embarrassing \Nto say out loud, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.90,0:07:11.38,sign_9702_79_Imp_chan_after_o,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs12\frz359.6\pos(492,334)}Thanks for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.38,0:07:14.16,sign_9702_79_Imp_chan_after_o,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs15\c&H4D5156&\frz359.1\pos(317,299)}Thanks for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.76,0:07:22.05,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I'd...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.72,0:07:25.16,main,Rin,0,0,0,,like to hear it from you directly, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.68,0:07:28.62,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Not "Eh?"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.79,0:07:32.20,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.04,0:07:36.32,main,Glossy-chan,0,0,0,,Oh, there you are, Kitahama-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.32,0:07:37.40,main,Classmate,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.63,0:07:39.44,main,Glossy-chan,0,0,0,,Care to join us for lunch today?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.69,0:07:42.49,main,Rin,0,0,0,,No way... it's that \Npretty lady from earlier!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.96,0:07:45.67,main,Glossy-chan,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.24,0:07:47.81,main,Glossy-chan,0,0,0,,Is this the kouhai I've heard so much about?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.03,0:07:50.88,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,This is her. She came in secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.34,0:07:54.43,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Rin, these gals are from my acting club.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.43,0:07:55.89,main,Rin,0,0,0,,It's nice to meet you...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.89,0:07:57.08,main,Classmate,0,0,0,,Hey there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.44,0:08:00.16,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Does that mean you spend \Na lot of time together?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.45,0:08:02.70,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Well... yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.76,0:08:07.84,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,They're all girls...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.84,0:08:11.66,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Only relatively! Subjectively! In contrast!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.45,0:08:15.46,main,Glossy,0,0,0,,I get the feeling we'd be \Ninterrupting something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.46,0:08:17.26,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Sorry about that...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.49,0:08:18.44,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.44,0:08:25.57,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I'd like to eat lunch with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.30,0:08:28.22,main,eiji,0,0,0,,Rin... You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.43,0:08:31.11,main,eiji,0,0,0,,We're not gonna get \Na lot of chances like today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.30,0:08:33.74,main,Glossy,0,0,0,,You two will have less time together.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.74,0:08:37.86,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I came here to see how \Npopular Senpai is at college!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.08,0:08:39.86,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I won't get many other chances!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.14,0:08:43.31,main,Classmate,0,0,0,,Huh. You mean with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.31,0:08:50.75,main,Classmate,0,0,0,,I'll jump straight to the point. \NKitahama-kun's not particularly popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.93,0:08:52.62,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.62,0:08:53.76,main,Classmate,0,0,0,,I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.76,0:08:57.13,main,Classmate,0,0,0,,usually he just makes a bunch of noise \Nwith Iwata-kun and the other guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.34,0:09:01.08,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,J-Just making noise?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.08,0:09:02.52,main,Classmate,0,0,0,,Exactly like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.52,0:09:05.86,main,Glossy,0,0,0,,The other day, you got into an fight \Nover the last pudding at the school store...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.14,0:09:07.74,main - flashback,Tsuu,0,0,0,,Got the last one!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.74,0:09:09.44,main - flashback,Eiji,0,0,0,,Give her back to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.28,0:09:14.78,sign_13266_124_Pudding,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&HACD7E6&\b1\frz51.05\pos(339,111)}{\blur0.4\fs16\fnComic Sans MS\i0}Pudding
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.62,0:09:19.53,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You can take her...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.88,0:09:23.16,main,Glossy,0,0,0,,Personally, I'm not into... exuberant guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.54,0:09:24.76,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,See what I mean, Rin?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.06,0:09:26.84,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I'm not popular at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.23,0:09:28.72,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Also, aren't they mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.72,0:09:30.03,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Senpai...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.12,0:09:33.84,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I'm... kind of relieved.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.34,0:09:40.20,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You basically just finished me off... \Nnow I'm actually kinda bummed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.29,0:09:44.43,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Maybe I should start crying and fussing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.43,0:09:46.30,main,Classmate,0,0,0,,He's at it again...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.80,0:09:50.19,main,Rin,0,0,0,,You can have this, so please cheer up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.20,0:09:58.57,main - top,Club 1,0,0,0,,Everything about the previous \Nengagement was so wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.57,0:10:01.44,main,Club 3,0,0,0,,Miss Elizabeth's piano was quite something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.68,0:10:01.44,main - top,Club 2,0,0,0,,Her cooking was incredible, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.44,0:10:02.24,main,Elizabeth (Rin),0,0,0,,You really think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.44,0:10:04.94,main - top,Club 1,0,0,0,,Truly, the venison rounds \Nwere prepared just right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.36,0:10:04.69,main,Club 3,0,0,0,,Oh, truly?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.70,0:10:09.71,main,Club 3,0,0,0,,I'd love to hear you play our piano \Nsomeday. It's simply exquisite.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.96,0:10:09.68,main - top,Club 2,0,0,0,,Everyone was discussing how they'd never \Nseen such splendid cuts of meat before.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.68,0:10:11.49,main - top,Club 1,0,0,0,,Even Mr. Darcy thought so...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.71,0:10:11.49,main,Club 3,0,0,0,,Most likely more than yours...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.12,0:10:14.72,main,Darcy,0,0,0,,Good evening, Mrs. Catherine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.74,0:10:20.86,main,Darcy,0,0,0,,Begging your pardon, but I need \Nto have a word with Miss Elizabeth...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.26,0:10:23.23,main,Darcy,0,0,0,,In private.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.85,0:10:27.36,main,Club Member,0,0,0,,Whatever about?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.04,0:10:57.00,main,Darcy,0,0,0,,Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.87,0:11:09.34,main,Darcy,0,0,0,,There's something... \Nthat I feel I must tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.60,0:11:11.21,main,Elizabeth,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.55,0:11:14.38,main,Darcy,0,0,0,,I have always been... \Na rather high-handed man,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.65,0:11:16.08,main,Darcy,0,0,0,,of hard-to-tolerate character.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.69,0:11:20.93,main,Darcy,0,0,0,,Meeting you has made me \Nmore aware of that fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.68,0:11:23.11,main,Darcy,0,0,0,,I'd like to apologize...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.03,0:11:28.60,main,Elizabeth,0,0,0,,Well, I should also apologize \Nfor misunderstanding you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.04,0:11:35.19,main,Elizabeth,0,0,0,,And I'd like to offer thanks \Non behalf of my entire family
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.20,0:11:37.90,main,Elizabeth,0,0,0,,for how kindly you've treated Lydia.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.52,0:11:44.36,main,Prez,0,0,0,,It's been a while since I've seen it, \Nbut Nanakura-san is still an amazing actress.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.36,0:11:46.03,main,Prez,0,0,0,,And this is with no preparation!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.56,0:11:49.15,main,Senpai 1,0,0,0,,Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.15,0:11:51.56,main,Prez,0,0,0,,Even the older members are all captivated.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.65,0:11:51.56,main - top,Senpai 2,0,0,0,,She's in high school still...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.70,0:11:57.12,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I was the one who invited her to drama club!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.44,0:12:00.28,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I'm kind of a big deal to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.28,0:12:01.57,main,Tsuu,0,0,0,,Why you little...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.12,0:12:04.67,main,Tsuu,0,0,0,,You just don't get it, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.20,0:12:06.32,main,Tsuu,0,0,0,,Listen up...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.67,0:12:09.32,main,Tsuu,0,0,0,,You're a cocky, dense goober.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.90,0:12:12.28,main,Darcy,0,0,0,,I believe I know you very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.99,0:12:17.13,main,Darcy,0,0,0,,If you had no intention of getting married, \Nyou would've told Mrs. Catherine as much.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.02,0:12:21.61,main,Tsuu,0,0,0,,And she's a hard-working actress who knows \Nhow to go with the flow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.00,0:12:24.00,main,Elizabeth,0,0,0,,That's true!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.00,0:12:29.10,main,Elizabeth,0,0,0,,You know just how much \NI won't mince words about how I feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.92,0:12:34.56,main,Elizabeth,0,0,0,,Considering how, when \NI refused your previous proposal,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.56,0:12:37.23,main,Elizabeth,0,0,0,,I insulted you so harshly...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.52,0:12:40.22,main,Elizabeth,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.70,0:12:49.28,main,Tsuu,0,0,0,,Who do you think is the real prize?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.89,0:12:55.18,main,Elizabeth,0,0,0,,I honestly feel ashamed \Nof how I had acted before...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.01,0:12:59.83,main,Elizabeth,0,0,0,,Mr. Darcy... if you still feel \Nthe same way...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.01,0:13:07.75,main,Darcy,0,0,0,,Elizabeth... would you... \Ntake me as your husband?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.60,0:13:19.78,main,Tsuu,0,0,0,,Which one do you think \Npeople take seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.93,0:13:24.28,main,Elizabeth,0,0,0,,Yes... gladly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.90,0:13:30.91,sign_18558_208_Psuedo_Harem,Eyecatch sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(534,349)}Pseudo Harem
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.91,0:13:35.91,sign_18558_208_Psuedo_Harem,Eyecatch sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(182,345)}Pseudo Harem
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.14,0:13:39.94,main,Rin,0,0,0,,If you still feel the same way...!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.14,0:13:44.42,main,Handsome Club,0,0,0,,Then... will you marry me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.74,0:13:46.58,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Yes, gladly!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.58,0:13:48.17,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Hold it right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.36,0:13:50.40,main,Rin,0,0,0,,S-Senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.01,0:13:56.90,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Talk about a bad ending!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.90,0:13:58.60,main,Tsuu,0,0,0,,Good luck, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.94,0:14:03.52,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Hey, you there! What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.76,0:14:03.52,main - top,Prez,0,0,0,,Eiji!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.52,0:14:05.12,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.12,0:14:07.92,main,Club,0,0,0,,Hey! We don't need any props in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.35,0:14:11.57,main,Prez,0,0,0,,Come by again some time!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.57,0:14:12.57,main,Classmate,0,0,0,,Seeya!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.72,0:14:26.46,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Senpai, why'd you rush the scene like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.48,0:14:32.40,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.40,0:14:35.28,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I think I understand where you \Nwere coming from before.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.61,0:14:40.30,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,And maybe I was worried...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.82,0:14:45.42,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,But the way you were acting was too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.42,0:14:47.83,main,Rin,0,0,0,,It's just what the script says...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.19,0:14:51.10,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I wanna clobber whoever picked \Nthat script with a hammer!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.54,0:14:55.74,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Well, what did you think of my performance?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.50,0:14:59.98,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,It was... really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.82,0:15:04.25,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Which is probably what \Nmade me even more worried...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.76,0:15:12.87,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I guess we both ended up \Nworrying about the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.14,0:15:16.08,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You said you weren't \Nworried anymore, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.08,0:15:20.24,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Just a bit! It's not like \NI can totally rest easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.06,0:15:22.91,main,Rin,0,0,0,,So we're in the same boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.40,0:15:30.03,main,Imp Rin,0,0,0,,Or maybe you'd rest easier \Nif we got married?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.64,0:15:37.10,main,Rin,0,0,0,,P-Please say something...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.53,0:15:39.90,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Now I'm worried about \Nsomething else altogether!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.90,0:15:41.28,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,The ceremony?! And honeymoon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.28,0:15:42.69,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Where do we live?! How many kids?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.69,0:15:45.48,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Are they gonna cry all night?! \NRebellious phases?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.20,0:15:47.54,main - top,Rin,0,0,0,,Senpai! That was just acting! Acting!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.48,0:15:47.54,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Their coming of age ceremonies?! \NTheir marriages?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.52,0:15:56.60,main,Rin,0,0,0,,"The rain's making everything glitter!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.86,0:16:01.73,main,Rin,0,0,0,,The birdies are in a great mood, \Nand even the rainbow is crobbing..."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.77,0:16:05.74,main,Megu,0,0,0,,That was cute, how you flubbed that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.09,0:16:10.48,main,Rin,0,0,0,,But I flubbed it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.48,0:16:13.11,main,Megu,0,0,0,,Guess you're glad it \Nwasn't in front of Senpai-san, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.40,0:16:18.30,main,Rin,0,0,0,,"Tonight, my parents are glowing bout..."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.84,0:16:25.44,main,Rin,0,0,0,,...I need to rehearse more.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.44,0:16:27.08,main,Megu,0,0,0,,So serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.44,0:16:31.97,main,Megu,0,0,0,,Although I happen to like it \Nwhen you slack when acting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.24,0:16:35.39,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I only slack around you, Megu!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.39,0:16:39.34,main,Megu,0,0,0,,Aw, how's that taste for you, little baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.15,0:16:43.48,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Yummy-wummy! It taste weally good!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.83,0:16:47.15,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Seriously, I only do this \Nsort of thing in front of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.64,0:16:51.48,main,Megu,0,0,0,,Now show me how Baby-chan would eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.34,0:16:57.78,main,Rin,0,0,0,,You realize I'm a high \Nschool senior, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.78,0:17:00.35,main,Megu,0,0,0,,I want you to try that for Senpai-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.35,0:17:02.43,main,Megu,0,0,0,,I bet he'd think it was cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.43,0:17:04.79,main,Rin,0,0,0,,You only get this because \Nwe're childhood friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.79,0:17:06.50,main,Rin,0,0,0,,You should probably be grateful!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.95,0:17:08.75,main,Megu,0,0,0,,Fank yoo berry much!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.71,0:17:15.76,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Megu...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.18,0:17:20.74,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Do you wanna go somewhere \Non our next day off?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.17,0:17:26.14,main,Megu,0,0,0,,You sure? Not gonna see Senpai-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.44,0:17:29.32,main,Rin,0,0,0,,But I barely hang out with you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.68,0:17:31.70,main,Megu,0,0,0,,You've grown into such a sweet girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.33,0:17:36.03,main,Megu,0,0,0,,I'd love some steak.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.88,0:17:40.28,main,Rin,0,0,0,,What're you saying?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.73,0:17:45.04,main,Megu,0,0,0,,I've been so lonely... please be nice to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.04,0:17:48.47,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Wehhh, baby no understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.47,0:17:51.27,main,Megu,0,0,0,,Treat me, Baby-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.76,0:17:52.68,main,Kiri,0,0,0,,Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.85,0:18:00.05,main,Kiri,0,0,0,,Nanakura-senpai, um, \Ncan I talk to you for a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.24,0:18:01.47,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Kiri-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.33,0:18:04.60,main,Megu,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.10,0:18:07.81,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Uh... so what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.04,0:18:11.68,main,Kiri,0,0,0,,I was... hoping you'd \Nread some lines with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.22,0:18:15.16,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Oh, okay, sure thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.91,0:18:20.57,main,Kiri,0,0,0,,"I can't believe we're siblings, now..."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.96,0:18:22.95,main,Rin,0,0,0,,"I don't like it either."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.44,0:18:25.79,main,Kiri,0,0,0,,"You had better not tell anyone at school!"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.76,0:18:27.70,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.70,0:18:30.41,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I don't think you have anything \Nto worry about for the next performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.41,0:18:32.20,main,Rin,0,0,0,,That was better than \NI'd expect from a first-year.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.16,0:18:38.34,main,Kiri,0,0,0,,But... I feel like my acting \Nhasn't been good enough lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.86,0:18:40.72,main,Kiri,0,0,0,,And it's your fault, Nanakura-senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.13,0:18:45.92,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Um, s-sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.18,0:18:51.73,main,Kiri,0,0,0,,No... it's just, when \NI first saw your acting...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.12,0:19:11.85,main,Kiri,0,0,0,,I... couldn't look away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.40,0:19:20.52,main,Kiri,0,0,0,,Not just on a technical level, \Nbut... how do I put this...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.53,0:19:22.90,main,Kiri,0,0,0,,The way you were on stage...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.89,0:19:27.95,main,Rin,0,0,0,,It's okay, take your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.48,0:19:30.77,main,Kiri,0,0,0,,Please, don't be embarrassed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.70,0:19:36.24,main,Kiri,0,0,0,,Nanakura-senpai... \Nhow are you able to act like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.01,0:19:40.08,main,Kiri,0,0,0,,I want to get to know you better!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.02,0:19:50.28,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Kiri-chan... is there anyone you like?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.15,0:19:54.16,main,Rin,0,0,0,,When you care about someone,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.59,0:19:58.54,main,Rin,0,0,0,,you start to think more about what's \Ngoing on in their head than your own,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.95,0:20:00.56,main,Rin,0,0,0,,day after day...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.28,0:20:04.80,main,Rin,0,0,0,,and you can feel your emotions \Nchanging like you're a different person.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.44,0:20:10.27,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I think that might be what \Nhelps me figure out roles...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.81,0:20:12.98,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Or maybe not!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.94,0:20:20.65,main,Kiri,0,0,0,,Then there's someone you \Ncare about, Nanakura-senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.03,0:20:22.56,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Yep!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.38,0:20:28.78,main,Kiri,0,0,0,,I... haven't ever really felt \Nthat way before.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.99,0:20:31.90,main,Rin,0,0,0,,You seem pretty dedicated to the club, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.25,0:20:36.80,main,Kiri,0,0,0,,And lately I've been thinking \Nabout you all the time, Nanakura-senpai...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.82,0:20:38.79,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.80,0:20:45.28,main,Kiri,0,0,0,,No, not like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.28,0:20:48.50,main,Kiri,0,0,0,,That's not what I meant... \Nthe way I like you is more pure...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.50,0:20:49.29,main,Rin,0,0,0,,You like me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.29,0:20:50.69,main,Kiri,0,0,0,,Wait, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.69,0:20:52.91,main,Kiri,0,0,0,,I mean, it's true, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.91,0:20:54.35,main,Kiri,0,0,0,,When I say like I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.91,0:20:56.80,main - top,Rin,0,0,0,,Easy there, Kiri-chan! Let's just calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.80,0:20:56.80,main,Kiri,0,0,0,,Make it stop...!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.24,0:21:02.34,main,Rin,0,0,0,,My family is going to visit relatives \Nin the country over the summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.55,0:21:05.76,main,Rin,0,0,0,,But I'm going to be staying \Nbehind to watch the house!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.21,0:21:08.92,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Rin... you don't have to act cheery...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.37,0:21:12.08,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,If you're lonely, it's okay to cry, y'know?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.31,0:21:14.88,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Oh, no, it's not that!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.33,0:21:17.96,main,Rin,0,0,0,,What I mean is that, once it's summer break...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.60,0:21:25.84,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Would you come over to my place?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.84,0:21:32.09,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Say what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.60,0:21:46.16,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Looks like this is gonna \Nbe one hell of a hot summer!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.59,0:21:47.94,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.87,0:23:22.88,sign_33852_355_Much_Ado_About_N,Sign,0,0,0,,Much Ado About Nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.52,0:23:22.26,main,Eiji/Rin,0,0,0,,Much Ado About Nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.61,0:23:25.26,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I've got my lovely wife...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.09,0:23:30.41,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,And we're surrounded by our plucky kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.72,0:23:33.92,main,Tsuu,0,0,0,,Is that us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.06,0:23:37.17,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I'm so happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.40,0:23:38.23,main,Rin,0,0,0,,{onamatapeia to indicate hear strings being pulled}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.44,0:23:42.44,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I feel like, from a performance standpoint,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.44,0:23:45.03,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I could express this bliss better \Nif I had my head in your lap.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.48,0:23:47.06,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,And if that's what the role calls for...!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.50,0:23:49.95,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I-In my lap?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.95,0:23:51.95,main,,0,0,0,,
